<para>Pairing request and pairing response info structure. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This structure is the same for both smp_pairing_req and smp_pairing_rsp and a subset of the packet data, except for the initial Code octet. It is documented in Core Spec. Vol. 3, Part H, 3.5.1 and 3.5.2. </para>
